WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
- Thank you for being on
my first show, Dwayne,

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.410
- Yes, thank you for having me.

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:06.076
- Very excited (audience
cheering and clapping)

00:00:06.076 --> 00:00:09.000
- Before we get to anything
else, as I said before the break

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.890
you hadn't actually planned on being here.

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:12.900
Your baby brother, Kevin Hart,

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.430
because that's what you
call him, your baby brother.

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:15.263
- Yeah.

00:00:15.263 --> 00:00:16.096
- He was supposed to be here

00:00:16.096 --> 00:00:17.070
but he was in a car accident weeks ago.

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:18.690
So everything's good with
him now though, right?

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:20.622
- Everything is good.

00:00:20.622 --> 00:00:21.455
I spoke with Kevin,

00:00:21.455 --> 00:00:22.971
I actually refer to him as my son.

00:00:22.971 --> 00:00:24.240
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.590
I connected with him today,

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:27.660
and you know what, these
things happen in life,

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.450
and thankfully, he -
- Right?

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:31.380
- he was strapped in
nicely to his car seat.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:32.610
So I think that everything,

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:34.136
(Kelly and audience laughing)

00:00:34.136 --> 00:00:35.302
(Dwayne laughs)

00:00:35.302 --> 00:00:37.777
- Oh God, I love you! (laughing)

00:00:37.777 --> 00:00:39.669
That's, like, that's real love.

00:00:39.669 --> 00:00:40.994
- That's real love, guys.

00:00:40.994 --> 00:00:41.827
- Love, that's love.

00:00:41.827 --> 00:00:42.830
- Listen, I'm only kidding.
- Yeah.

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:45.455
- We spoke to the
pediatrician and he said -

00:00:45.455 --> 00:00:47.281
(Kelly and audience laughing)

00:00:47.281 --> 00:00:49.440
he's doing very well.
- Oh gosh.

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:50.790
- He is bummed he couldn't
be here, as you know.

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:52.110
But look, I love the guy.

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:55.230
He's one of my best friends
and honestly, I mean,

00:00:55.230 --> 00:00:57.120
Thank God, it could have been,
could've been a lot worse.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:58.043
So he is a lucky man.
- Yeah.

00:00:58.043 --> 00:00:59.967
- And I'm so happy he's, you know,

00:00:59.967 --> 00:01:01.633
(audience clapping)
yeah,

00:01:01.633 --> 00:01:03.424
(audience cheering)
and he knows it too,

00:01:03.424 --> 00:01:04.950
and I wish him the best
and speedy recovery,

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:06.480
and I'm gonna see him soon.

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:09.210
- And you two have the
best chemistry, like,

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:10.043
- We got a good chemistry.

00:01:10.043 --> 00:01:12.360
- It's, I mean, I love every
film you've done together, like

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:13.920
I love you-all, and "Jumanji,"

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:15.535
I'm gonna be real with you, okay, Dwayne?

00:01:15.535 --> 00:01:16.503
- [Dwayne] Oh, thank you (laughing)

00:01:16.503 --> 00:01:18.300
- When I saw the preview
that they were doing

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:19.740
another "Jumanji," I was, like,

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:20.882
that's not a good idea.

00:01:20.882 --> 00:01:22.020
(Dwayne and audience laughing)

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:24.000
'Cause, like, because like
the original was so good.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:24.833
- [Dwayne] Yes.

00:01:24.833 --> 00:01:27.339
- But, yours was amazing, like, I was -

00:01:27.339 --> 00:01:28.172
- [Dwayne] Thank you.

00:01:28.172 --> 00:01:29.005
(audience cheering)

00:01:29.005 --> 00:01:30.138
- [Kelly] I freaked out, we have seen it.

00:01:30.138 --> 00:01:30.971
- Thank you so much.

00:01:30.971 --> 00:01:31.804
- We have seen it so much,

00:01:31.804 --> 00:01:34.260
my family and my kids, we
all, they love the part where

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.353
the hippo eats Jack Black
every time, but yeah,

00:01:36.353 --> 00:01:37.186
(Dwayne laughs)

00:01:37.186 --> 00:01:38.490
it's weird, I don't want kids like that?

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:39.323
That's weird, but -

00:01:39.323 --> 00:01:40.922
- All kids love that part, by the way.

00:01:40.922 --> 00:01:41.755
- (Kelly) That's so weird.

00:01:41.755 --> 00:01:42.690
- Yes, they love that part.

00:01:42.690 --> 00:01:44.113
- It's a little Jeffrey
Dahmer, but yeah, yeah.

00:01:44.113 --> 00:01:46.008
It's a little weird.
- But you go with it.

00:01:46.008 --> 00:01:47.341
- (Kelly) Yeah, I go with it.

